*)


(*"product_property_definition_schema.acyclic_shape_aspect_occurrence"
The **acyclic_shape_aspect_occurrence** function determines whether the graph of instances of the entity data type <<express:product_property_definition_schema.shape_aspect_occurrence,shape_aspect_occurrence>> that are linked by the attribute <<express:product_property_definition_schema.shape_aspect_occurrence.definition,definition>> contains a cycle.

The function returns TRUE if no cycle has been detected. Otherwise it returns FALSE.
*)


(*"product_property_definition_schema.acyclic_shape_aspect_occurrence.__note"
